              "Only the named forward tag is imported; other tags, reverse and ping-pong directions, trimming, offsets, layers and user data are refused or ignored, never reinterpreted.",
              "Godot stores relative durations; Schemaxis fixes 1 frame per second so each stays authored milliseconds."
